---
layout: default
---

{% assign start_ts = page.date | date: "%s" | plus: 0 %}
{% assign end_ts = start_ts | plus: 518400 %}
{% assign start_month = start_ts | date: "%m" %}
{% assign end_month = end_ts | date: "%m" %}
{%- comment -%} 題は title、なければ期間。上のナビの真ん中は「diary / 2026week46」（diary は一覧へのリンク）。title がある週は期間を題の下に副題として出す。見出しの右下は「投稿日：YYYY年M月D日」だけ（2026-11-10、本人「過剰」で一行にした） {%- endcomment -%}
{% capture week_id %}{{ page.date | date: "%G" }}w{{ page.date | date: "%V" | plus: 0 }}{% endcapture %}
{% capture week_range %}{{ start_ts | date: "%Y/%m/%d" }}–{% if start_month == end_month %}{{ end_ts | date: "%d" }}{% else %}{{ end_ts | date: "%m/%d" }}{% endif %}{% endcapture %}
{% if page.title and page.title != "" and page.title != page.slug %}{% assign page_title = page.title %}{% else %}{% assign page_title = nil %}{% endif %}

{% assign sorted_diary = site.diary | sort: "date" %}
{% assign prev_entry = nil %}
{% assign next_entry = nil %}
{% for entry in sorted_diary %}
  {% if entry.url == page.url %}
    {% assign current_index = forloop.index0 %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% assign prev_index = current_index | minus: 1 %}
{% assign next_index = current_index | plus: 1 %}
{% for entry in sorted_diary %}
  {% if forloop.index0 == prev_index %}
    {% assign prev_entry = entry %}
  {% endif %}
  {% if forloop.index0 == next_index %}
    {% assign next_entry = entry %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

<div class="post diary-content">
  <nav class="diary-nav">
    {% if prev_entry %}
      <a href="{{ prev_entry.url | relative_url }}" class="diary-nav-prev">
        ← {{ prev_entry.date | date: "%G" }}w{{ prev_entry.date | date: "%V" | plus: 0 }}
      </a>
    {% else %}
      <span class="diary-nav-prev"></span>
    {% endif %}
    <span class="diary-nav-index"><a href="{{ '/diary/' | relative_url }}">diary</a> / {{ page.date | date: "%G" }}week{{ page.date | date: "%V" | plus: 0 }}</span>
    {% if next_entry %}
      <a href="{{ next_entry.url | relative_url }}" class="diary-nav-next">
        {{ next_entry.date | date: "%G" }}w{{ next_entry.date | date: "%V" | plus: 0 }} →
      </a>
    {% else %}
      <span class="diary-nav-next"></span>
    {% endif %}
  </nav>

  {%- comment -%} front matter の cover（assets/img/diary/ の写真）があれば題の上に出す。題が二度続かないよう、題の入っていない元の写真（SNS は題入りのカード、bin/diary_cards.py）。2026-11-10 {%- endcomment -%}
  {% if page.cover %}
    <figure class="week-cover"><img src="{{ page.cover | prepend: '/assets/img/diary/' | relative_url }}" width="1280" height="670" alt=""></figure>
  {% endif %}

  <header class="post-header">
    <h1 class="post-title">{% if page_title %}{{ page_title }}{% else %}{{ week_range }}{% endif %}</h1>
    {% if page_title %}<p class="diary-subtitle">{{ week_range }}</p>{% endif %}
    {%- comment -%} 右寄せは投稿日だけ。週の名前は上のナビ、期間は副題（題がない週は題そのもの）。シリーズ名は出さない（本人の希望） {%- endcomment -%}
    <p class="diary-posted">投稿日：{{ page.date | date: "%Y年%-m月%-d日" }}</p>
    {% if page.description and page.description != "" %}
      <p class="post-description">{{ page.description }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </header>

  {% assign days_content = content | split: "<!-- day -->" %}
  <nav class="diary-days-nav">
    {% for day in days_content %}
      {% assign day_offset = forloop.index0 | times: 86400 %}
      {% assign day_ts = start_ts | plus: day_offset %}
      <a href="#d{{ day_ts | date: "%m%d" }}">{{ day_ts | date: "%d" }} <small>{{ day_ts | date: "%a" }}</small></a>
    {% endfor %}
  </nav>

  <article class="post-content">
    {% for day in days_content %}
      {% assign day_offset = forloop.index0 | times: 86400 %}
      {% assign day_ts = start_ts | plus: day_offset %}
      <h2 id="d{{ day_ts | date: "%m%d" }}">{{ day_ts | date: "%m/%d" }} <small>{{ day_ts | date: "%a" }}</small></h2>
      {{ day }}
    {% endfor %}
  </article>

  <nav class="diary-nav diary-nav-bottom">
    {% if prev_entry %}
      <a href="{{ prev_entry.url | relative_url }}" class="diary-nav-prev">
        ← {{ prev_entry.date | date: "%G" }}w{{ prev_entry.date | date: "%V" | plus: 0 }}
      </a>
    {% else %}
      <span class="diary-nav-prev"></span>
    {% endif %}
    <span class="diary-nav-index"><a href="{{ '/diary/' | relative_url }}">diary</a> / {{ page.date | date: "%G" }}week{{ page.date | date: "%V" | plus: 0 }}</span>
    {% if next_entry %}
      <a href="{{ next_entry.url | relative_url }}" class="diary-nav-next">
        {{ next_entry.date | date: "%G" }}w{{ next_entry.date | date: "%V" | plus: 0 }} →
      </a>
    {% else %}
      <span class="diary-nav-next"></span>
    {% endif %}
  </nav>
</div>
